.TH "ORBIT" "1" "Aug 2026" "Orbit Developer Platform" "Orbit Platform Manual"

.SH NAME
orbit-config-set - Set a configuration key-value pair


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbit config set   [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Update a specific configuration setting by key and persist it using comment-preserving AST yaml.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for set

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Print the result as a JSON envelope


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	Custom path to configuration file


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBorbit-config(1)\fP
